// "59.8%". Measured over every map x lens: 373 of 3,694 rows -- one in ten -- stated the shrunk rate
// at a different precision from the rest of the same column, in the one place the reader is sent to
// find it. The blob is already 1dp server-side (aggregate_maps rounds it); only the render dropped
