// lazy TMGRP blob, so a match is found even before any drilldown has ever been parsed. Silent no-op
// when the pair never cleared TEAMMATE_MIN_GAMES (no row exists): partner_block only emits this
// link once the pair clears its OWN stricter floor (COPLAY_MIN_SHOW=15 > TEAMMATE_MIN_GAMES=5), so
