// default sort from Games to Lift, so that player sees their best partners first instead of
// their most-played ones. A blank filter or one still matching 2+ players reverts to Games —
// col indices mirror teammates_mode_html's cols list (0 names,1 Games,2 QM win%,3 Comp win%,
// 4 Lift -- reordered 2026-07-23, evidence before conclusion; keep this in lockstep with that
